ex:SolactiveTransatlanticCleanEnergyEURIndexNTRName a ex:IndexName, owl:NamedIndividual .
ex:SolactiveTransatlanticCleanEnergyEURIndexTRName a ex:IndexName, owl:NamedIndividual .
ex:SolactiveTransatlanticCleanEnergyEURIndex50ARName a ex:IndexName, owl:NamedIndividual .
ex:SolactiveTransatlanticCleanEnergyEURIndex5PercentARName a ex:IndexName, owl:NamedIndividual .
